From: Phillipe Cardenuto <phillipe.cardenuto@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 10:27:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs: add 2026 literature on digital forensics for
 scientific integrity

Adds 68 entries across nine sections, covering January-August 2026:
image forensics for biomedical figures, AI-generated text and
fabricated-reference detection, cell line and reagent integrity,
retraction bibliometrics, and integrity reports.

Introduces a Public Retraction Datasets subsection under Statistics
and Science of Science, with a matching table of contents entry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
